"""
iot_scanner.py - IoT Camera / Drone Security Assessment Tool

For authorized internal security testing only.
Do not use on devices you do not own or have explicit permission to test.

Modules:
  1. UART auto-baud detection + shell access detection
  2. Firmware extraction (via UART shell) + offline save
  3. Firmware analysis (binwalk + string-based credential/secret scanning)
  4. Network discovery (common IoT/camera/drone service ports)
  5. MAVLink drone assessment (signing check, plaintext telemetry, benign
     command-acceptance test)
  6. BLE sniffing (device discovery + GATT enumeration, exposed-credential
     scanning on readable characteristics)

Author: internal security tooling. Output: structured JSON findings.
"""

